            <title>3.15.3</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 23:46:55 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>186</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.15.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Clicking a file link in a session opened in a repository's main checkout now opens files in that repository's worktrees, with a plain click or Cmd-click. Previously the click was silently ignored.
- Links from a worktree session into files under the main checkout's build folders open again, including files inside nested package checkouts.
]]></description>
